[[30,7,1152,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2585190\">Op. 7050A02 SIDE REAR INDIVIDUAL SEAT (ONE), LEFT OR RIGHT - R.R.</a></p><p>1. Undo the cushion bolts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003450.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[30,7,1152,"<p>1. Remove the cushion from the seat.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003451.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[30,7,1152,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the cushion on the seat backrest.</p><p>Tighten the bolts securing the cushion to the seat backrest.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585190\">Op. 7050A02 SIDE REAR INDIVIDUAL SEAT (ONE), LEFT OR RIGHT - R.R.</a></p>"]]